{"unit_id":"H-table__dsh-github-tool#feature-1","repo":"H-table/dsh-github-tool","commit":"0a7561003fec4914271d394319ea37e24321332c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH GitHub Tool 的功能「REST API 调用」：github_api 按指定路径调用 GitHub REST API，返回 JSON 或原始文本。可设置方法、查询参数、请求体和超时，并使用已配置凭据认证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:231-274"]}
{"unit_id":"H-table__dsh-github-tool#feature-2","repo":"H-table/dsh-github-tool","commit":"0a7561003fec4914271d394319ea37e24321332c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH GitHub Tool 的功能「多文件提交」：通过 github_push_files 将多份文本或本地文件写入仓库并创建单个提交，返回提交 SHA 和链接。调用时提供文件路径与内容或本地路径、目标仓库及提交信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:276-387"]}
{"unit_id":"H-table__dsh-github-tool#feature-3","repo":"H-table/dsh-github-tool","commit":"0a7561003fec4914271d394319ea37e24321332c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH GitHub Tool 的功能「GraphQL 查询」：github_graphql 向 GitHub 发送查询或 mutation，并返回 data 与 errors。用户提供查询文本及可选 variables，也可设置调用超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:389-430"]}
{"unit_id":"H-table__dsh-github-tool#feature-4","repo":"H-table/dsh-github-tool","commit":"0a7561003fec4914271d394319ea37e24321332c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH GitHub Tool 的功能「创建 Discussion」：通过 github_create_discussion 在指定仓库发布标题和 Markdown 正文。工具会解析仓库及分类；未指定分类时使用首个可用分类，并返回讨论链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:432-501"]}
